wnloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/testcontainers/testcontainers-java/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/testcontainers/testcontainers-java/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/testcontainers/testcontainers-java/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/testcontainers/testcontainers-java/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/testcontainers/testcontainers-java/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/testcontainers/testcontainers-java/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/testcontainers/testcontainers-java/deployments","created_at":"2015-04-12T12:44:59Z","updated_at":"2025-12-12T10:50:04Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-11T18:10:38Z","git_url":"git://github.com/testcontainers/testcontainers-java.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:testcontainers/testcontainers-java.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/testcontainers/testcontainers-java.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/testcontainers/testcontainers-java","homepage":"https://testcontainers.org","size":14821,"stargazers_count":8531,"watchers_count":8531,"language":"Java","has_issues":true,"has_projects":false,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":1772,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":574,"license":{"key":"mit","name":"MIT License","spdx_id":"MIT","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/mit","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTEz"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["docker","docker-compose","hacktoberfest","integration-testing","java","junit","jvm","test-automation","testing"],"visibility":"public","forks":1772,"open_issues":574,"watchers":8531,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"**GIVEN**: Win 10 machine\r\n`\r\n        <dependency>\r\n            <groupId>org.testcontainers</groupId>\r\n            <artifactId>testcontainers</artifactId>\r\n            <version>1.4.2</version>\r\n            <scope>test</scope>\r\n        </dependency>\r\n`\r\n\r\n**WHEN**: Start docker compose in a test\r\n\r\n    @ClassRule\r\n    public static DockerComposeContainer dockerCompose = new DockerComposeContainer(ID, COMPOSE_FILE)\r\n            .withLocalCompose(true)\r\n            .withPull(false)\r\n            .withTailChildContainers(true)\r\n            .withExposedService(\"elastic\", 9200)\r\n            .withExposedService(\"logstash\", 9600)\r\n            .withExposedService(\"stats\", 8282);\r\n`\r\n\r\nTHEN:\r\n`\r\norg.testcontainers.containers.ContainerLaunchException: Local Docker Compose not found. Is docker-compose on the PATH?\r\n\tat org.testcontainers.containers.LocalDockerCompose.invoke(DockerComposeContainer.java:497)\r\n\tat org.testcontainers.containers.DockerComposeContainer.runWithCompose(DockerComposeContainer.java:151)\r\n\tat org.testcontainers.containers.DockerComposeContainer.createServices(DockerComposeContainer.java:127)\r\n\tat org.testcontainers.containers.DockerComposeContainer.starting(DockerComposeContainer.java:111)\r\n`\r\n\r\n\r\nThis heppend because of (DockerComposeContainer, line 498): `CommandLine.executableExists(COMPOSE_EXECUTABLE)`\r\n\r\n    public static boolean executableExists(String executable) {\r\n\r\n        // First check if we've been given the full path already\r\n        File directFile = new File(executable);\r\n        if (directFile.exists() && directFile.canExecute()) {\r\n            return true;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        for (String pathString : getSystemPath()) {\r\n            Path path = Paths.get(pathString);\r\n            if (Files.exists(path.resolve(executable)) && Files.isExecutable(path.resolve(executable))) {\r\n                return true;\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        return false;\r\n    }\r\n\r\nFile like docker-compose can't be resolved in PATH, because of there is docker-compose.exe binary on Win10, not simple docker-compose. \r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/testcontainers/testcontainers-java/issues/460/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/testcontainers/testcontainers-java/issues/460/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]